---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Legal title="Refunds" description="VisualOn refund policy: when you get a full refund, what happens after work has started, and how to ask." updated="7 October 2026">
  <p>We want you to be happy with your video. Here's how refunds work.</p>
  <h2>Full refund</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If you cancel before we've started work (before we reply with questions or a direction).</li>
    <li>If we can't take the order, for example because the product can't be shown or the queue is full.</li>
    <li>If we miss the delivery window and you'd rather not wait.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>After work has started</h2>
  <p>Once we've started, we fix problems with revisions instead of refunds: that's what the revision rounds are for. If the first cut clearly doesn't match the package or your brief, tell us within 7 days of delivery and we'll either remake it or refund up to 50% of the order.</p>
  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with your payment ID. We reply within 2 working days. Approved refunds go back to the original payment method through Dodo Payments, usually within 5–10 working days.</p>
</Legal>
